1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
The problem with traditional dentistry.

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:04,460
Most dental visits follow the same pattern.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:09,660
You come in, someone counts your gums, looks
for cavities, maybe takes

4
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:11,120
some x -rays, then you leave.

5
